[{"short_id":"7fcuxz","created_at":"2026-11-02T21:58:06.895-06:00","title":"Why did you choose the nix you nix?","url":"","score":6,"flags":0,"comment_count":7,"description":"\u003cp\u003eI don't which nix is good and at this point I'm afraid I need to ask.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e(Cpp)\u003ca href=\"https://nixos.org/\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003eNix\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://determinate.systems/\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003eDeterminate Nix\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://lix.systems/\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003eLix\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOr, you know, \u003ca href=\"https://guix.gnu.org/\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003eGuix\u003c/a\u003e?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e(I \u003cem\u003esuspect\u003c/em\u003e that \u003ca href=\"https://snix.dev/\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003eSnix\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https://code.tvl.fyi/tree/tvix\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003eTvix\u003c/a\u003e, and others aren't intended for general use… but I might be wrong?)\u003c/p\u003e\n","description_plain":"I don't which nix is good and at this point I'm afraid I need to ask.\r\n\r\n- (Cpp)[Nix](https://nixos.org/)\r\n- [Determinate Nix](https://determinate.systems/)\r\n- [Lix](https://lix.systems/)\r\n\r\nOr, you know, [Guix](https://guix.gnu.org/)?\r\n\r\n(I _suspect_ that [Snix](https://snix.dev/), [Tvix](https://code.tvl.fyi/tree/tvix), and others aren't intended for general use… but I might be wrong?)","submitter_user":"quad","user_is_author":true,"tags":["ask","nix"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/7fcuxz","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/7fcuxz/why_did_you_choose_nix_you_nix"},{"short_id":"lw6q21","created_at":"2026-11-02T20:39:11.587-06:00","title":"Inference Cooperative — AI, governed together","url":"https://inference.coop/","score":-4,"flags":5,"comment_count":0,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"saulshanabrook","user_is_author":false,"tags":["ai","building-ai-tooling"],"